        </h1>
        <p className="hero-tagline"></p>
        <div className="hero-divider"></div>
        <p className="hero-desc">
          I make things for the web. Code, design, whatever it takes to ship something that actually works and looks good doing it.
        </p>
        <div className="hero-ctas">
          <a href="#projects" className="btn-primary">View Work</a>
          <a href="#contact" className="btn-ghost">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
        <div className="scroll-indicator">
          <span>Explore</span>
          <div className="scroll-line"></div>
          <div className="scroll-chevrons">
            <div className="scroll-chevron"></div>
            <div className="scroll-chevron"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* ABOUT */}
      <section id="about">
        <Drips color={accent} enabled={tweaks.dripsEnabled}/>
        <div className="section-blood alt">†</div>
        <div className="section-inner about-grid">
          <div className="about-portrait reveal">
            <div className="about-portrait-border2"></div>
            <div className="about-portrait-frame">
                <div className="about-portrait-border"></div>
                <div className="about-portrait-corner tl">⌜</div>
                <div className="about-portrait-corner br">⌟</div>
                <img src="portrait.png" alt="x1yzl" style={{width:'100%',height:'100%',objectFit:'cover',objectPosition:'center top',display:'block'}}/>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div className="about-text">
            <div className="section-label reveal">01 — Who I Am</div>
            <h2 className="section-title reveal reveal-delay-1">The Architect<br/>Behind the Code</h2>
            <div className="section-sep reveal reveal-delay-2"></div>
            <p className="reveal reveal-delay-2">
              I'm <strong>x1yzl</strong> — I do frontend, backend, and design. Started coding because I wanted to build my own stuff, stayed because I genuinely love it. I care a lot about how things look AND how they work under the hood.
            </p>
            <p className="reveal reveal-delay-3">
              Most of my work is web apps — React, Node, the usual stack. I also do UI/UX when a project needs it, which is honestly most of the time. Still learning, always shipping.
            </p>
            <div className="about-stats reveal reveal-delay-4">
              <div className="stat-card">
                <span className="stat-icon">⟁</span>
                <span className="stat-number">3+</span>
